      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is something they are actually working on, not directly HTTP pass through but saving variables for a player. It's called Player Persistence and has been announced in a developer stream in April.\nYou can read more about it in their dev stream recap here: \nhttps://medium.com/vrchat/vrchat-april-2021-dev-stream-recap-8502bb8c9163",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
